# 27
#title Record editor webview failures in Diagnostics
#url https://github.com/MobileReality/lantern/pull/27
#branch feat/editor-diagnostics
#base feat/app-diagnostics
#opened 2026-11-10
#head ca51f637d719d063bbde65d7cbf65e1576427578
#describe what Console errors, failed loads and freezes of the embedded editor page are recorded in Diagnostics as Editor entries, with harmless noise dropped and the connection token removed.
#describe before An error inside the editor left nothing in the log.
#describe after It appears as Editor / Warning; load failures and freezes are errors. Warnings are hidden and left out of whole-log reports until you tick Editor console warnings.
#describe verified typecheck, lint and the full unit suite are green. The behaviour was not seen running in the app.
